{"parentUuid":"f396a8c8-7264-4998-a2d3-052bafa9e5cd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfKHq44w65wUPLSkM32v5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Context:** Ran a full Claude Code stack/config audit (install, version, settings, plugins, MCP servers, skills, hooks, permissions) across 50 recent sessions plus a 30-day pass over 303 sessions. User interrupted before any changes were applied.\n\n**Key Exchanges:**\n- Audit report delivered: install is healthy — single native copy at `~/.local/bin/claude`, version 2.1.280 (current), all settings files parse, auto mode already default, no agent files, CLAUDE.md files total ~1.9k est. tokens with no duplicates or conflicts.\n- 38 blocked permission actions reviewed; none were plain read-only commands, so no allow rules were proposed.\n\n**Decisions Made:**\n- Proposed (NOT yet applied — user interrupted): disable 5 unused plugins in `~/.claude/settings.json` under `enabledPlugins` — `desktop-commander@synced`, `firecrawl@synced`, `browser-use@synced`, `exa@synced`, `cowork-plugin-management@synced`. Zero uses since install, ~1.9k est. tokens saved per session.\n- Keep `Claude Docs` connector (too new to judge). Keep `persistent-localhost` skill but fix it, not remove it.\n- HyperFrames by HeyGen connector flagged for removal (~400 tokens loaded every session, and it blocks its main tools in Claude Code) — user must do this manually via `/mcp`, per-project.\n\n**Lessons Learned:**\n- A `: \"` sequence inside a YAML `description:` line breaks the whole SKILL.md frontmatter, so Claude Code silently ignores the entire header. File: `~/.agents/skills/persistent-localhost/SKILL.md`. Fix is `description: >-` with the text on following lines. It is a vendored skill, so a vendor update can reintroduce the break.\n- **The dcg hook is dead on Windows** — 913 failures. Windows settings point at the Mac path `/Users/kristinarash/.local/bin/dcg`, so the dcg guard checks nothing there. Related to the existing \"Config encoding damage from Windows\" memory note.\n- The skill-router hook runs on every user message: ~1.6 s typical, 68 s worst case, 2 timeouts recorded.\n- `/context` gives exact live context numbers; audit figures were estimates.\n\n**Action Items:**\n- Apply (or explicitly decline) the 5-plugin disable in `~/.claude/settings.json`.\n- Fix the `persistent-localhost` SKILL.md frontmatter.\n- User: run `/mcp` and disable HyperFrames (per-project).\n- Fix the dcg hook path on the Windows laptop.\n- Investigate the slow skill-router hook."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":29039,"cache_read_input_tokens":10923,"output_tokens":933,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":29039,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":933,"cache_read_input_tokens":10923,"cache_creation_input_tokens":29039,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":29039},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfKHq3bfE6suXCe7RLErA","type":"assistant","uuid":"178c325d-4b1c-4fdf-9ccb-06e73ed8609f","timestamp":"2026-09-22T22:46:57.693Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-py","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/.claude/claude-memory-compiler","sessionId":"e907977b-fbc0-4254-8804-6e14665c3c98","version":"2.1.259","gitBranch":"main"}
